Drops the result of a GeoJSON URL response that is still building in the
background when setURL, setGeoJSON, or setGeoJSONData replaces it, so the stale
build can't overwrite the newer data or URL when it replies
(https://github.com/maplibre/maplibre-native-ffi/issues/1719). The tests need
StubFileSource::respondToAll to stop erasing from the map it iterates.
Upstream: not proposed

